{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/white-april/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"6bf1992f-b74f-59fa-859d-d4e4f1cead7c","strapi_id":40,"ShortDescription":"For the bride who loves romance with ease. White April creates airy, feminine gowns with soft silhouettes and subtle details–beautiful on their own and customizable to feel uniquely yours.","PriceRangeLow":"180000","PriceRangeHigh":"295000","Name":"WHITE APRIL","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"White April is for the bride who loves romance, but on her own terms. Thoughtful silhouettes, airy textures, and subtle details come together to create gowns that feel effortless, feminine, and quietly captivating. It’s beauty without trying too hard–refined, modern, and full of feeling."}]},{"children":[{"text":"White April is known for their intentional design, timeless craftsmanship, and an appreciation for the art of dressing a bride with ease and authenticity, with limitless customizations to make a bride’s dress truly their own. "}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#d8d8c8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/5d42e/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.jpg","srcSet":"/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/d78f7/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.jpg 335w,\n/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/1f568/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.jpg 669w,\n/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/5d42e/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.jpg 1338w","sizes":"(min-width: 1338px) 1338px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/b87f3/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.webp 335w,\n/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/6bb29/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.webp 669w,\n/static/c6baafad7629805a9a6ca820fb5bb10e/9b58f/whiteapril_desktop_c7a0117422.